    [Doc] Remove legacy DSA-CP documentation (#19491)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    Remove legacy DSA-CP documentation and migrate deployment examples to
    PCP with the same context-parallel size. Keep GLM-5.3-Flash KPool
    examples on TP because PCP is unsupported.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    No; documentation only.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    Static expansion of 60 service commands and 12 launchers, plus JSON and
    local-link checks. No NPU runs.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/a98247ab4db686ee03c66d5feb3c761e52a2f8ab
    
    Signed-off-by: leolee <yihao.li@huawei.com>

